{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  CUSTOM LIQUID/HTML SECTION
  =============================================================================
  Flexible section for custom Liquid code and HTML content
  - Allows merchants to add custom code without theme modifications
  - Supports both Liquid templating and raw HTML
  - Configurable spacing and container options
  - Useful for custom functionality, third-party integrations, and testing
  - Provides flexibility for advanced customization needs
{% endcomment %}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  MAIN CONTAINER WITH DYNAMIC SPACING
  =============================================================================
  Primary container with conditional spacing and container classes
  - section-spacing: Default vertical spacing between sections
  - container: Default contained width for content
  - no_margins: Boolean setting to remove all spacing
  - data-cc-animate: JavaScript animation trigger for entrance effects
  - Responsive layout that adapts to custom content
{% endcomment %}
<div class="{% unless section.settings.no_margins %}section-spacing container{% endunless %}" data-cc-animate>
  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    CUSTOM LIQUID/HTML CONTENT RENDERING
    =============================================================================
    Renders custom Liquid code or HTML from section settings
    - section.settings.custom_liquid: Custom code input from theme editor
    - Supports Liquid templating language syntax
    - Can include HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and Liquid filters
    - Useful for custom widgets, third-party scripts, and advanced layouts
    - Content is rendered as-is without additional processing
  {% endcomment %}
  {{ section.settings.custom_liquid }}
</div>

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  SCHEMA CONFIGURATION
  =============================================================================
  Theme editor configuration for custom liquid section
  - name: Section name displayed in theme editor
  - class: CSS class for section-specific styling
  - settings: Configurable options for merchants
  - no_margins: Toggle for section spacing removal
  - custom_liquid: Textarea for custom code input
  - presets: Default section configuration for easy addition
{% endcomment %}
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Custom Liquid/HTML",
  "class": "section--custom-html",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "no_margins",
      "label": "No section spacing",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "type": "liquid",
      "id": "custom_liquid",
      "label": "Custom Liquid/HTML"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Custom Liquid/HTML"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
